message: "If you use cro-bpe, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cro-bpe: A Byte-Level BPE Tokenizer for Croatian"
abstract: >-
  A byte-level BPE tokenizer trained on a curated monolingual Croatian corpus,
  with a tiktoken export and the full pipeline from corpus download to evaluation.
authors:
